{'symbol': 'NEE', 'date': '2022-02-04 06:37:00', 'title': 'NEXTERA ENERGY AND NEXTERA ENERGY PARTNERS TO MEET WITH INVESTORS THROUGHOUT FEBRUARY', 'text': 'JUNO BEACH, FLA., FEB. 4, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0NEXTERA ENERGY, INC. (NYSE: NEE) AND NEXTERA ENERGY PARTNERS, LP (NYSE: NEP) TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT MEMBERS OF THE SENIOR MANAGEMENT TEAM WILL PARTICIPATE IN VARIOUS INVESTOR MEETINGS THROUGHOUT FEBRUARY.'}